	Rain: It doesn't give any loot it just... 
- It's not a mimic right?
	P: It's not a mimic right? There are way too many of those
	Rain: No it's weird its like...
Rain: People interact with it and then if they die they just appear right here...
Rain: ...
Rain: Its a checkpoint and it fills your health.
