~ s2
if Gameplay.Knight == true:
	=> s22

Cpt Wright: My sword is missing!
- ...Maybe check your hilt?
	P: ...Maybe check your hilt? Just a thought?
	Cpt Wright: No I stole this blade.
	Cpt Wright: I stole it from an old woman's house. She almost didn't see it coming. But I got caught
	Cpt Wright: Turns out she has dementia, so I convinced her I was her grandson.
	Cpt Wright: Left with a sword, gold in my pocket and mead in the belly. God is good.
	set Gameplay.Knightgrandma = true
- Dude. I saw a witch named Rain who had it.
	P: Dude. A witch north of here is using it right now.
	Cpt Wright: You are a blessing.
	Cpt Wright: When I finish flexing in the sun, I will take it from her.
	P: We are in a cave, there is no sun.
	Cpt Wright: When your future is as bright as mine you don't need a sun
	Cpt Wright: You just need hard work and steroids.
set GameplayKnight = true
=> END

~ s22
Cpt Wright: You still need something? I don't do autographs, or lighthouses...but that is a different story
